Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.44,0:22:56.02,EDCN2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,203,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(6262,6580,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}在我面前  你总是很温柔
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.06,0:23:02.63,EDCN2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,230,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(5235,5570,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}但那份温柔  却让我不安
